# bo

--- BowDude_MineTrigger | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_BO_MINE_TRIGGER_DESC
raw  Bo triggers all of his mines after <VALUE1> seconds. During the delay the mines are completely undetectable to opponents.
now  Bo triggers all of his mines after <VALUE1> seconds. During the delay the mines are completely undetectable to opponents.
  VALUE1  -  -> 1.5

--- BowDude_MineTrigger | gadget | TID_BOWDUDE_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Bo fires tripwires at his mines, detonating them and causing <!buddy.accessory.customobjectprojectile.customuniquepropertyvalue.scaletolevel> to anyone hit by a tripwire. Detonated mines have a bigger blast radius!
now  Bo fires tripwires at his mines, detonating them and causing <!buddy.accessory.customobjectprojectile.customuniquepropertyvalue.scaletolevel> to anyone hit by a tripwire. Detonated mines have a bigger blast radius!
  buddy.accessory.customobjectprojectile.customuniquepropertyvalue.scaletolevel  -  -> 1440

--- BowDude_Totem | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_BOW_TOTEM_DESC
raw  Bo places a totem that increases allies' Super charging rate by <!card.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.areaEffect.customValue1>%. The totem slowly loses its health over time.
now  Bo places a totem that increases allies' Super charging rate by <!card.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.areaEffect.customValue1>%. The totem slowly loses its health over time.
  card.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.areaEffect.customValue1  -  -> 50

--- BowDude_Totem | gadget | TID_BOWDUDE_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Bo places a totem that increases allies' Super charging rate by <!card.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.areaEffect.customValue1>%. The totem slowly loses its health over time. The totem has a significantly increased radius!
now  Bo places a totem that increases allies' Super charging rate by <!card.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.areaEffect.customValue1>%. The totem slowly loses its health over time. The totem has a significantly increased radius!
  card.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.areaEffect.customValue1  -  -> 50

--- BowDude_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_SPOT_DESC
raw  Bo spots enemies hidden in bushes from <VALUE1>% longer distance than normally.
now  Bo spots enemies hidden in bushes from 5% longer distance than normally.
  VALUE1  5  -> 150

--- BowDude_unique | star power | TID_BOWDUDE_BUDDY_STARPOWER_1_DESC
raw  Bo spots enemies hidden in bushes from +<!card.value1_legacy_spot>% further away. Bo is no longer revealed when attacking from bushes.
now  Bo spots enemies hidden in bushes from +<!card.value1_legacy_spot>% further away. Bo is no longer revealed when attacking from bushes.
  card.value1_legacy_spot  -  -> 150

--- BowDude_unique_2 | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_STUN_TRAP_DESC
raw  Instead of a knockback, Bo's traps now stun the enemy for <VALUE1> seconds!
now  Instead of a knockback, Bo's traps now stun the enemy for 40 seconds!
  VALUE1  40  -> 2

--- BowDude_unique_2 | star power | TID_BOWDUDE_BUDDY_STARPOWER_2_DESC
raw  Instead of a knockback, Bo's traps now stun the enemy for <!card.value1.ticksAsSeconds> sec and trap placement speed is significantly increased.
now  Instead of a knockback, Bo's traps now stun the enemy for 2 sec and trap placement speed is significantly increased.
  card.value1.ticksAsSeconds  2  -> 2
